Package: claude-agent-matrix
Version: @VERSION@-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: crunchtools <scott.mccarty@crunchtools.com>
Depends: claude-agent (= @VERSION@-1)
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/crunchtools/claude-agent
Description: reach a claude-agent session by Matrix text
 A bridge that carries texts from allowed Matrix senders to the session that
 claude-agent run holds, and texts back each turn's final answer and command
 results, with a typing indicator while a turn runs.
